# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，防止 shell 脚本在 Linux 上因 CRLF 报错
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.glb binary
